  "description": "***Available Immediately***\n\n***Please reply by email with full details of all applicants***\n\nPerfectly located and comfortable one-bedroom apartment set within a large period house, ideally positioned between Rathmines and Ranelagh villages. This newly refurbished property is within easy reach of a wide selection of cafés, restaurants, St. Stephen’s Green, and the city centre.\n\nExcellent transport links are close at hand, with both Beechwood and Ranelagh LUAS stations just a short stroll away. The location is also within walking distance of the city centre, Trinity College, TU Dublin, the Swan Leisure Centre, Swan Shopping Centre, Stella Cinema, and a variety of well-known supermarkets.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a spacious living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, and a generously sized double bedroom.",
